  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ST & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{3} & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\text{\u00a0}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 6 \\\\ -6 & -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(-\\frac{2}{3})\\cdot 6+(-2)\\cdot (-6) & (-\\frac{2}{3})\\cdot 6+(-2)\\cdot (-4) \\\\ 2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-6) & 2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4+12 & -4+8 \\\\ 12+(-6) & 12+(-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n.",
